1
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:08,352
=Episode 19=

2
00:00:08,680 --> 00:00:09,200
Mother,

3
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:11,080
I'm taking you back with me.

4
00:00:13,839 --> 00:00:14,640
My child,

5
00:00:15,279 --> 00:00:16,759
we don't have much time.

6
00:00:16,759 --> 00:00:18,359
I only have time
to tell you a few things.

7
00:00:18,359 --> 00:00:19,439
Listen to me.

8
00:00:20,519 --> 00:00:21,640
Your father

9
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:24,120
may have fallen into demonic corruption

10
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:25,239
and lost all reason and humanity.

11
00:00:27,199 --> 00:00:28,239
My sudden death back then

12
00:00:29,239 --> 00:00:30,160
was his doing.

13
00:00:32,679 --> 00:00:33,600
Are you saying...

14
00:00:37,199 --> 00:00:38,719
Father murdered you, Mother?

15
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:41,880
Perhaps

16
00:00:42,759 --> 00:00:44,640
he stopped being your father long ago,

17
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:47,479
and stopped being my Yunling too.

18
00:00:50,159 --> 00:00:51,119
My child,

19
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:52,920
I hid a magical artifact
in the Archive Pavilion.

20
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:54,719
It is called the Demon-Revealing Mirror.

21
00:00:54,719 --> 00:00:55,439
Find it.

22
00:00:56,119 --> 00:00:57,920
If he's no longer your father,

23
00:00:59,359 --> 00:01:00,520
you must kill him.

24
00:01:00,679 --> 00:01:02,399
Do you know what you're saying?

25
00:01:03,320 --> 00:01:04,159
Yunlie,

26
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:06,600
if Yunling has truly fallen
to demonic corruption,

27
00:01:06,719 --> 00:01:09,359
he's a threat to you and all of Huyun.

28
00:01:10,799 --> 00:01:12,439
If the Demon Lord
seizes this chance to break free,

29
00:01:12,920 --> 00:01:15,239
all of Huyun will become his puppet.

30
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:17,000
Is that what you want to see?

31
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:21,560
In the Netherworld,

32
00:01:22,519 --> 00:01:23,959
throughout these endless years,

33
00:01:25,599 --> 00:01:28,159
I've heard Yunling's agonized screams
countless times.

34
00:01:29,359 --> 00:01:30,519
He's in so much pain.

35
00:01:31,159 --> 00:01:31,959
Yunlie...

36
00:01:33,159 --> 00:01:34,519
Help him find release.

37
00:01:37,159 --> 00:01:37,959
Mother.

38
00:01:39,920 --> 00:01:40,760
My child,

39
00:01:42,040 --> 00:01:42,840
to be able

40
00:01:43,519 --> 00:01:45,000
to see you one more time

41
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:46,560
makes me truly happy.

42
00:01:47,359 --> 00:01:48,280
I'm so happy.

43
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:50,640
In the days to come,

44
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:52,640
remember to eat well,

45
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:56,000
and don't kick off your blankets
like you did when you were little.

46
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:56,840
Okay?

47
00:01:58,840 --> 00:01:59,920
In this lifetime,

48
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:03,239
having all of your father's love

49
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:05,560
and a son as wonderful as you,

50
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:07,000
I'm already so happy.

51
00:02:08,480 --> 00:02:09,920
It's only a shame that I can't

52
00:02:11,239 --> 00:02:12,799
stay by your side any longer.

53
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:14,879
Mother?

54
00:02:17,439 --> 00:02:18,240
Mother!

55
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:20,000
Mother...

56
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:23,960
Mother!

57
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:29,520
Jin Yunlie,

58
00:02:30,159 --> 00:02:30,919
wake up.

59
00:02:32,199 --> 00:02:33,000
Jin Yunlie,

60
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:35,120
wake up.

61
00:02:37,719 --> 00:02:38,520
Jin Yunlie.

62
00:02:52,784 --> 00:02:56,110
♪I shut out the world, you're all I see♪

63
00:02:56,380 --> 00:02:59,216
♪One glance to last forever,
just you and me♪

64
00:02:59,719 --> 00:03:00,599
Wake up.

65
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:02,199
Jin Yunlie,

66
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:04,520
wake up.

67
00:03:07,630 --> 00:03:10,448
♪Lost in the gaps where rain
slips through, life's a fleeting line♪

68
00:03:13,039 --> 00:03:13,879
Jin Yunlie,

69
00:03:14,719 --> 00:03:15,639
wake up.

70
00:03:17,479 --> 00:03:18,280
Jin Yunlie.

71
00:03:21,380 --> 00:03:24,848
♪The wind hasn't risen tonight.
Missing you might be an illness♪

72
00:03:24,912 --> 00:03:27,180
♪The long misty rain scatters in haste♪

73
00:03:28,060 --> 00:03:32,640
♪Letting go may be love's last line♪

74
00:03:39,879 --> 00:03:41,360
Has he already begun
crossing the River of Oblivion?

75
00:03:42,319 --> 00:03:43,639
Then how do I get there?

76
00:03:43,639 --> 00:03:44,439
Xi Yuan,

77
00:03:45,080 --> 00:03:46,199
you want to go to the River of Oblivion?

78
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:49,479
The River of Oblivion is under
the Netherworld's jurisdiction.

79
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,199
Almost no one has ever

80
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:53,280
managed to get a soul back from him.

81
00:03:54,639 --> 00:03:55,719
Even so,

82
00:03:56,400 --> 00:03:57,439
I have to try.

83
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:58,719
Tell me,

84
00:03:58,840 --> 00:04:00,199
how do I get to the River of Oblivion?

85
00:04:02,319 --> 00:04:03,879
When a person is on the verge of death,

86
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:06,000
their soul has a chance

87
00:04:06,479 --> 00:04:07,479
of reaching the Netherworld.

88
00:04:08,159 --> 00:04:08,719
Alright.

89
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:10,879
I'm going to find him.

90
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:18,520
♪After the world fades away,
you alone stay in my sight♪

91
00:04:18,640 --> 00:04:22,170
♪Rouge sachets and jade towers
can't match your dance in the light♪

92
00:04:22,544 --> 00:04:29,280
♪Once the heart knows love's design,
it's you I seek, and intertwine♪

93
00:04:38,279 --> 00:04:39,199
Xi Yuan!

94
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:57,439
Xi Yuan!

95
00:05:00,639 --> 00:05:01,439
Xi Yuan...

96
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:03,600
I have to go back.

97
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:05,319
You can't go against the current.
Turn back!

98
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:06,240
Out of my way!

99
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:13,680
All hail the Netherworld Sovereign.

100
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:16,319
You're already dead, body and soul gone.

101
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:18,199
Why refuse to
cross the River of Oblivion

102
00:05:18,399 --> 00:05:19,680
and seek your next life?

103
00:05:20,839 --> 00:05:21,720
I can't go.

104
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:24,040
There is someone I must protect.

105
00:05:24,759 --> 00:05:25,879
Protect?

106
00:05:27,399 --> 00:05:29,040
You have already died,
body and soul gone.

107
00:05:29,399 --> 00:05:30,879
With what will you protect her?

108
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:31,920
If I refuse to cross,

109
00:05:32,639 --> 00:05:33,959
I still have a chance to return.

110
00:05:34,319 --> 00:05:35,199
Return?

111
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:37,040
No one has ever

112
00:05:37,519 --> 00:05:39,360
left my domain.

113
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:40,759
My life and death

114
00:05:41,959 --> 00:05:43,000
are not yours to decide.

115
00:05:52,759 --> 00:05:54,560
The Jin clansman of the Xuanji Realm,

116
00:05:55,199 --> 00:05:56,439
if you persist in this folly,

117
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:58,480
you shall be cast
into the Unending Hell,

118
00:05:58,480 --> 00:06:00,040
never to reincarnate for all eternity.

119
00:06:01,839 --> 00:06:03,399
Like I said...

120
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:06,600
There's someone

121
00:06:09,279 --> 00:06:10,000
waiting for me

122
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:12,480
to return.

123
00:06:16,879 --> 00:06:18,160
Utterly obstinate.

124
00:06:27,199 --> 00:06:28,160
Jin Yunlie,

125
00:06:29,279 --> 00:06:31,399
you shall pay the price for defying

126
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:33,120
the laws of the Netherworld.

127
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:56,160
Xi Yuan?

128
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:00,319
She'd go this far

129
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:02,920
for you?

130
00:07:03,879 --> 00:07:04,839
What happened to Xi Yuan?

131
00:07:10,839 --> 00:07:12,839
She's risking her life to save you.

132
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:15,040
So I'll give you one more chance.

133
00:07:21,279 --> 00:07:22,959
The only thing equal in value to a life

134
00:07:23,279 --> 00:07:24,439
is a future.

135
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:26,560
Every human future

136
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:28,279
is born of cause and bears its effect.

137
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:29,800
The law of karma is inexorable.

138
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:31,879
If you wish to live,

139
00:07:32,319 --> 00:07:34,160
I can only take away her future.

140
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:35,839
You may leave,

141
00:07:36,519 --> 00:07:37,560
but from this day forward,

142
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:38,639
I will decide

143
00:07:39,079 --> 00:07:40,279
her future.

144
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:52,040
Netherworld Sovereign,

145
00:07:53,639 --> 00:07:56,199
it seems you underestimate me
far too much.

146
00:07:58,399 --> 00:08:00,879
How could I hand over
the future of the woman I love

147
00:08:00,879 --> 00:08:03,360
just to save my own skin?

148
00:08:05,399 --> 00:08:06,240
What's more,

149
00:08:07,079 --> 00:08:08,680
it's her future.

150
00:08:10,240 --> 00:08:11,279
I have no right to decide,

151
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:14,079
and I'd never presume
to decide it for her.

152
00:08:15,399 --> 00:08:16,600
If you demand a price,

153
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:19,160
then take my future.

154
00:08:19,399 --> 00:08:21,199
I'm the one who went upstream
against the River of Oblivion.

155
00:08:21,279 --> 00:08:23,560
I'm the one who violated
the laws of the Netherworld.

156
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:24,839
The one who should bear all of this

157
00:08:24,839 --> 00:08:26,199
is me, and me alone.

158
00:08:26,839 --> 00:08:27,879
Not her.

159
00:08:30,079 --> 00:08:31,279
Your future?

160
00:08:32,439 --> 00:08:33,720
You're already dead.

161
00:08:34,800 --> 00:08:36,759
What future do you even have left?

162
00:08:36,759 --> 00:08:38,080
(His future includes me.)

163
00:08:41,399 --> 00:08:42,600
The Gate of Rebirth?

164
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:47,759
So, you found your way here after all.

165
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:55,000
Xi Yuan...

166
00:08:56,240 --> 00:08:56,919
How did you...

167
00:08:57,720 --> 00:08:58,519
Jin Yunlie!

168
00:09:19,879 --> 00:09:21,759
You two are separated by life and death.

169
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:23,600
Naturally, you can't touch one another.

170
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:25,720
Xi Yuan,

171
00:09:26,080 --> 00:09:27,519
you've trespassed into the Netherworld.

172
00:09:27,799 --> 00:09:29,320
Do you not fear divine punishment?

173
00:09:31,480 --> 00:09:32,159
Shisi?

174
00:09:33,480 --> 00:09:34,559
Is that you?

175
00:09:35,399 --> 00:09:36,200
Shisi?

176
00:09:52,759 --> 00:09:53,759
I never imagined

177
00:09:54,879 --> 00:09:56,919
you'd be the ruler of the Netherworld.

178
00:09:57,440 --> 00:09:58,240
Xi Yuan,

179
00:09:59,000 --> 00:09:59,639
I'm sorry

180
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:03,000
that you had to see
my true form under these circumstances.

181
00:10:03,759 --> 00:10:04,320
So...

182
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:07,000
you're the one at the end of
that life-or-death tribulation

183
00:10:07,519 --> 00:10:08,919
you told me about.

184
00:10:13,248 --> 00:10:19,100
♪A love letter, a passionate pursuit,
the envy of everyone♪

185
00:10:20,064 --> 00:10:26,080
♪Bouquets and heartfelt confessions,
leaving me moved and fulfilled♪

186
00:10:27,056 --> 00:10:33,020
♪No matter how long or hard our road,
I don't care♪

187
00:10:33,020 --> 00:10:39,040
♪But you left me with this pain,
forever beyond redemption♪
